{"ref":"BDB, חָדַשׁ","hw":"חָדַשׁ","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חָדַשׁ</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb.</strong> only <strong>Pi.</strong> (and <strong>Hithp.</strong>) <strong>renew, repair</strong> (poet. and late) <strong>(</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">חדש</span>; n. <span dir=\"rtl\">חדש</span> <em>new moon</em>, also in <span dir=\"rtl\">קרתחדשת</span> <em>new-city</em> = <em>Carthage;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">حَدَثَ</span> and <span dir=\"rtl\">חַדֵּשׁ</span>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܰܕܶܬ</span> <em>be new</em>, Ethiopic ሐደሰ i. 2. <em>renew;</em> Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">החדתֿ</span>, v. Os (Levy)<sup>ZMG 1865, 204</sup> Mordt<sup>ZMG 1876, 30</sup>; Assyrian [<em>adâšu</em>], <em>uddiš</em>, <em>renew</em>, <em>eššu</em>, <em>new</em>, etc. Dl<sup>W 199 ff.</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Pi.</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחִדְּשׁוּ</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.4\">Is 61:4</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְחַדֵּשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.8\">2 Ch 15:8</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּחַדֵּשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 10:17\" href=\"/Job.10.17\">Jb 10:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:30\" href=\"/Psalms.104.30\">ψ 104:30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וּנְחַדֵּשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.14\">1 S 11:14</a>; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַדֵּשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:12\" href=\"/Psalms.51.12\">ψ 51:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:21\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.21\">La 5:21</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְחַדֵּשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.4\">2 Ch 24:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.12\">12</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>renew, make anew</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמְּלוּכָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.14\">1 S 11:14</a> (editorial); <span dir=\"rtl\">פני אדמה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:30\" href=\"/Psalms.104.30\">ψ 104:30</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:12\" href=\"/Psalms.51.12\">51:12</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בּרא</span>); = bring back <span dir=\"rtl\">יָמֵינוּ כְּקֶדֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:21\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.21\">La 5:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ עדיך</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 10:17\" href=\"/Job.10.17\">Jb 10:17</a> i.e. <em>bringest fresh</em> (<em>new</em>) <em>witnesses</em>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>repair</em>, cities <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.4\">Is 61:4</a>, temple <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.4\">2 Ch 24:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.12\">12</a>, altar <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.8\">2 Ch 15:8</a>.<br><strong>Hithp.</strong>  Impf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּתְחַדֵּשׁ</span> c. pl. subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳ כַּנֶּשֶׁר נְעוּרָ֑יְכִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:5\" href=\"/Psalms.103.5\">ψ 103:5</a> <em>thy youth reneweth itself, like the eagle</em>.","next":"BDB, חָדָשׁ","prev":"BDB, חַדְרָ֔ךְ"}